ine-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise py-2.5" type="date" value=""><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The date the balances are struck at, in the year ending 30/06/2027.</p></div><div><label for="totalBalance" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total opening balance<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalBalance" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums py-2.5" value=""></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-3">Administrative fund</h3><div class="space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><label for="admin-cash" class="flex-1 text-sm text-ink">Cash at bank</label><input id="admin-cash" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums max-w-[11rem]" value=""></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><label for="admin-receivable" class="flex-1 text-sm text-ink">Levies receivable (including interest)</label><input id="admin-receivable" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums max-w-[11rem]" value=""></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><label for="admin-advance" class="flex-1 text-sm text-ink"><span class="text-ink-muted">less </span>Levies paid in