utton"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Address &amp; Settings<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Address &amp; Settings</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-6">Set the property address, financial settings, and preferences.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="address" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Street Address<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="address" required="" placeholder="e.g. 42 Macquarie Street" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="address"></div><div class=""><label for="suburb" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Suburb<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="suburb" required="" placeholder="e.g. Sydney" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="suburb"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><label for="state" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">State<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><select id="state" name="state" required="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="NSW" selected="">New South Wales</option></select><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Only New South Wales buildings can be set up for now.</p></div><div class=""><label for="postcode" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Postcode<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="postcode" required="" placeholder="2000" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="postcode"></div></div><div class=""><label for="financialYearEnd" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Financial Year End<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="financialYearEnd" required="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="date" value="2027-06-30" name="financialYearEnd"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The last day of the building's current financial year (day, month and year).</p></div><div class=""><label for="paymentPlan" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Payment Plan</label><select id="paymentPlan" name="paymentPlan" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="" selected="">Select plan...</option><option value="QUARTERLY">Quarterly</option><option value="MONTHLY">Monthly</option><option value="ANNUALLY">Annually</option><option value="HALF_YEARLY">Half-Yearly</option></select></div></div><div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-line"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Settings</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" checked="" name="isActive"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Active</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Property is currently active</p></div></label></div><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" name="allInclusiveFees"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">All Inclusive Fees</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Include all fees in levy calculations</p></div></label></div><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" name="debtCollection"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Debt Collection</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Enable automatic debt collection</p></div></label></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-line"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Property photo (optional)</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4">Shown on the building's page and beside it in your list of schemes. JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 10 MB. You can add or change it later.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div class="fle