uments</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">File format supported: .docx, .pdf</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Max file size: 30MB</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Skip — enter manually</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " disabled="" type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 12V4"></path><path d="M4 8l4-4 4 4"></path></svg>Upload</button></div></div></div><form novalidate=""><input type="hidden" value="[{&quot;lotNumber&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;unitNumber&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;entitlement&quot;:&quot;40&quot;,&quot;ownerName&quot;:&quot;J CITIZEN&quot;},{&quot;lotNumber&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;unitNumber&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;entitlement&quot;:&quot;60&quot;,&quot;ownerName&quot;:&quot;ACME PTY LTD&quot;}]" name="lotsJson"><input type="hidden" value="{&quot;takeoverDate&quot;:&quot;2026-10-01&quot;,&quot;totalBalance&quot;:&quot;2,000&quot;,&quot;admin&quot;:{&quot;cashAtBank&quot;:&quot;1,000&quot;,&quot;leviesReceivable&quot;:&quot;300&quot;,&quot;leviesInAdvance&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;creditors&quot;:&quot;200&quot;,&quot;fundBalance&quot;:&quot;1,000&quot;},&quot;capitalWorks&quot;:{&quot;cashAtBank&quot;:&quot;900&quot;,&quot;leviesReceivable&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;leviesInAdvance&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;creditors&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;fundBalance&quot;:&quot;1,000&quot;}}" name="balancesJson"><input type="hidden" value="[{&quot;lotNumber&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;admin&quot;:&quot;300&quot;,&quot;interestAdmin&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;capitalWorks&quot;:&quot;60&quot;,&quot;interestCapitalWorks&quot;:&quot;40&quot;,&quot;unallocated&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;lotNumber&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;admin&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;interestAdmin&quot;:&quot;x&quot;,&quot;capitalWorks&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;interestCapitalWorks&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;unallocated&quot;:&quot;100&quot;}]" name="lotBalancesJson"><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Property Details</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-6">Enter the core details of the Owners Corporation.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Scheme Name<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="name" required="" placeholder="e.g. Harbour View Towers OC" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="name"></div><div class=""><label for="planNumber" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Plan Number<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="planNumber" required="" placeholder="e.g. SP 12345" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="planNumber"></div><div class=""><label for="folio" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Folio</label><input id="folio" placeholder="e.g. 12345/678" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="folio"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Land title folio reference</p></div><div class=""><label for="abnNumber" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">ABN</label><input id="abnNumber" placeholder="e.g. 12 345 678 901" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="abnNumber"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Optional</p></div><div class=""><label for="buildingType" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Building Type</label><select id="buildingType" name="buildingType" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="">Select type...</option><option value="STRATA">Strata</option><option value="COMMUNITY">Community</option><option value="COMPANY_TITLE">Company Title</option><option value="STRATUM">Stratum</option></select></div><div class=""><label for="buildingSubType" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Building Sub-Type</label><select id="buildingSubType" name="buildingSubType" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="">Select sub-type...</option><option value="Residential">Residential</option><option value="Commercial">Commercial</option><option value="Mixed Use">Mixed Use</option><option value="Industrial">Industrial</option><option value="Retail">Retail</option></select></div><div class=""><label for="buildingClass" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Building Class</label><select id="buildingClass" name="buildingClass" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="">Select class...</option><option value="1">Class 1 — Detached houses</option><option value="2">Class 2 — Apartments / units</option><option value="3">Class 3 — Residential (other)</option><option value="5">Class 5 — Office</option><option value="6">Class 6 — Retail / shops</option><option value="7">Class 7 — Storage / car parks</option><option value="8">Class 8 — Laboratory / production</option><option value="9">Class 9 — Public building</option></select></div><div class=""><label for="totalLots" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total Lots<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalLots" required="" placeholder="e.g. 24" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="number" name="totalLots"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The lots on the strata plan. The Lots step must have this many.</p></div><div class=""><label for="totalEntitlement" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total Unit Entitlement<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalEntitlement" required="" placeholder="e.g. 1000" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="number" name="totalEntitlement"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The aggregate unit entitlement. The lots' unit entitlements must add up to it.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Address &amp; Settings<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Address &amp; Settings</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-6">Set the property address, financial settings, and preferences.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><label for="address" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Street Address<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="address" required="" placeholder="e.g. 42 Macquarie Street" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="address"></div><div class=""><label for="suburb" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Suburb<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="suburb" required="" placeholder="e.g. Sydney" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="suburb"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><label for="state" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">State<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><select id="state" name="state" required="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="NSW" selected="">New South Wales</option></select><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Only New South Wales buildings can be set up for now.</p></div><div class=""><label for="postcode" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Postcode<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="postcode" required="" placeholder="2000" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="text" name="postcode"></div></div><div class=""><label for="financialYearEnd" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Financial Year End<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="financialYearEnd" required="" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" type="date" value="2027-06-30" name="financialYearEnd"><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The last day of the building's current financial year (day, month and year).</p></div><div class=""><label for="paymentPlan" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Payment Plan</label><select id="paymentPlan" name="paymentPlan" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="" selected="">Select plan...</option><option value="QUARTERLY">Quarterly</option><option value="MONTHLY">Monthly</option><option value="ANNUALLY">Annually</option><option value="HALF_YEARLY">Half-Yearly</option></select></div></div><div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-line"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Settings</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" checked="" name="isActive"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Active</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Property is currently active</p></div></label></div><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" name="allInclusiveFees"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">All Inclusive Fees</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Include all fees in levy calculations</p></div></label></div><div class=""><label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-line text-turquoise focus:ring-turquoise" type="checkbox" value="true" name="debtCollection"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Debt Collection</span><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Enable automatic debt collection</p></div></label></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-line"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Property photo (optional)</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4">Shown on the building's page and beside it in your list of schemes. JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 10 MB. You can add or change it later.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div class="flex h-24 w-36 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-dashed border-line text-xs text-ink-muted">No photo chosen</div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><label class="inline-flex h-10 cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-turquoise bg-white px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-turquoise">Choose photo<input accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" class="sr-only" type="file"></label></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Lots &amp; Owners<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Lots and Owners</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-5">Enter every lot with its unit entitlement, and each owner's name exactly as it appears on the strata roll (for example joint owners, or a company with its ACN).</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Lots: 2 entered of 2 on the building</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Unit entitlement: 100 entered of 100 total</span></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line"><table class="w-full min-w-[640px] text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-muted/50 text-left"><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-24">Lot</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-24">Unit No.</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-32">Unit Entitlement</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted">Owner name (as on the strata roll)</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 w-12"><span class="sr-only">Remove</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-line/60 align-top"><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Lot number, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value="1"></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit number, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value=""></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit entitlement, row 1" inputmode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value="40"></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Owner name as on the strata roll, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" maxlength="500" value="J CITIZEN"></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right"><button type="button" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-ink-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-ink" aria-label="Remove row 1">×</button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-line/60 align-top"><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Lot number, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value="2"></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit number, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value=""></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit entitlement, row 2" inputmode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value="60"></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Owner name as on the strata roll, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" maxlength="500" value="ACME PTY LTD"></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right"><button type="button" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-ink-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-ink" aria-label="Remove row 2">×</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Add lot</button></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="