ard)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Reconciles with the balance sheet</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Total $2,000.00 equals administrative $1,000.00 plus capital works $1,000.00 ($2,000.00)</span></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-muted">Other balances (investments, prepayments, GST) are not entered here. If the building has them, load the full trial balance in Finance, under Data Migration, before signing off the cutover.</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Lot Balances<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Lot Opening Balances</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-5">What each owner owes at the takeover date: the levies and the interest owing in each fund, as shown in the previous manager's handover. Unallocated is money an owner has paid that is not yet applied to a levy: it is held as a credit in the administrative fund. Type the amounts as the handover prints them: a minus sign is fine (Urbanise shows an amount owing as -250.12), because each column already says whether the amount is owed or a credit.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Admin levies and interest $300.00 of $300.00 receivable</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Capital works levies and interest $100.00 of $100.00 receivable</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Unallocated $100.00 of $100.00 paid in advance</span></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line"><table class="w-full min-w-[880px] text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-muted/50 text-left"><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-16">Lot</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-me