ium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">No</dd></div></dl></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-3">Opening Balances</h3><dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2"><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Takeover Date</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">01/10/2026</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Total</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$2,000.00</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Administrative Fund</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$1,000.00</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Capital Works Fund</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$1,000.00</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Lot Levies (Admin / Capital Works)</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$300.00 / $60.00</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Lot Interest (Admin / Capital Works)</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$0.00 / $40.00</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-line/50"><dt class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Lot Unallocated Credits</dt><dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink text-right tabular-nums">$100.00</dd></div></dl></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-3">Lots (2, unit entitlement 100)</h3><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-muted/50"><th scope="col" class="text-left px-